    "identifier": "hoshi-kujaku-peacock-plume",
    "description": "<p>1st Level Clan Feature</p>\n<p>The first and most prominent ability Hoshi clansmen unlock, the ability to materialize their Star Chakra in the shape of a beautiful peacock plumage.</p>\n<p>As a Bonus action, you can activate Kujaku Mode for the next minute, or until you dismiss it on your turn at no action cost. Once you use this mode, you cannot use it again until you complete a short rest.</p>\n<p>While in this mode, you suppress the penalties and negative effects of Star Sickness for the duration.</p>",
